    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tiny moves, building big picture stuff!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple magic of combining three matching tiles to make your city bigger and better. With an added sprinkle of strategy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Town with Unique Themes!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/20adc6e71e581d1b3b1e4f0d48677452.poster.avif?t=1728655970\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/20adc6e71e581d1b3b1e4f0d48677452.webm?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/20adc6e71e581d1b3b1e4f0d48677452.mp4?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our variety of themes lets you build a town in your ideal aesthetic, including festive options like Halloween and Christmas! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have we mentioned night mode?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/da5dd4fd8919c132190a1ebfecbc2660.poster.avif?t=1728655970\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/da5dd4fd8919c132190a1ebfecbc2660.webm?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/da5dd4fd8919c132190a1ebfecbc2660.mp4?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a dark mode gremlin? Us too! Switch to Night Mode and watch as your city grows &amp; glows under the stars. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rush</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers or stress. Merge, build, and expand at your pace, crafting your city your way. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Out with our Lo-Fi Tunes and Low-Poly Art</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tiny moves, building big picture stuff!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple magic of combining three matching tiles to make your city bigger and better. With an added sprinkle of strategy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Town with Unique Themes!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/20adc6e71e581d1b3b1e4f0d48677452.poster.avif?t=1728655970\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/20adc6e71e581d1b3b1e4f0d48677452.webm?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/20adc6e71e581d1b3b1e4f0d48677452.mp4?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our variety of themes lets you build a town in your ideal aesthetic, including festive options like Halloween and Christmas! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have we mentioned night mode?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/da5dd4fd8919c132190a1ebfecbc2660.poster.avif?t=1728655970\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/da5dd4fd8919c132190a1ebfecbc2660.webm?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715700/extras/da5dd4fd8919c132190a1ebfecbc2660.mp4?t=1728655970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a dark mode gremlin? Us too! Switch to Night Mode and watch as your city grows &amp; glows under the stars. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rush</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers or stress. Merge, build, and expand at your pace, crafting your city your way. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Out with our Lo-Fi Tunes and Low-Poly Art</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Proving that all good things come in threes! Welcome to Teeny Tiny Town, where you connect three identical tiles to evolve your city, merge by merge. Watch your metropolis grow from scratch, from 'aww' to 'awesome!'",
